:: Amber sell 1 [no-fainting-or-hunger no-party-time-loss] {"position":"3775,1975","size":"100,100"}
<center>\
<span class="amber">"Oh you wanna check what im selling? Go ahead then! By the way my stuff is cheaper than the others because the pricings here are ridiculous! Like are you kidding me 1K col for a iron sword?!? They don't even sell Oni gear here! I had to buy it from other players! It's extremely expensive too!!!"</span>

<div class="cols">\
    <div class="col1">\
        <div class="border1">\
	        <div class="paperdoll">\
    		    <img src = "Textures/Body/Mannequin.png" style="transform: translate(-20px);" />\
                <img class="sword" src = "Textures/weapons/Iron sword.png" style="transform: translate(-119px)" />\
    	    </div>\
        </div>\
        <div class="border2">\
            Iron sword:
            Slash DMG + 6
            Pierce DMG + 2.25
        </div>\
        <div class="border1">\
            <<link "Buy the sword | 723 col">>
                <<if $Coins >= 723>> 
                    <<set $sword4 to true>>
                    <<notify>> You bought an iron sword! <</notify>>
                    <<set $Coins -= 723>>
                    <<goto "Amber sell 1">>
                <<elseif $Coins <= 723>>
                    <<script>>
                        UI.alert("You dont have enough col!");
                    <</script>>
                <</if>>
             <</link>>
        </div>\
    </div>\
